@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# Regression (FB3: path pre-scan/parser reproduced the crash class they
# guard against). A legitimate, non-cyclic sh:inversePath chain 50000
# levels deep. Both path-node-is-acyclic (the pre-scan) and parse-path
# (the real parser) used to be native-recursive with no depth bound and
# overflowed the C stack around depth 15-20k even on this kind of
# perfectly legal input. Must validate (CONFORMS, sh:minCount 0) in
# bounded time -- no crash. Generated (50000 levels).
ex:S a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetNode ex:n ; sh:property [ sh:path ex:q0 ; sh:minCount 0 ] .

